			"text":"PRODUCTION:\n- KHOI LUONG WORKLOAD CUA AI + PRODUCTION: LON \n- CAC PHAN MEM DANG SU DUNG: HRIS / GTAS SAL / GTAS PRODUCTION:\n\t- **CAN CAI THIEN THEM: KET NOI DUOC TOT HON** \n\t- GTAS TNA + GTAS QC: TRONG DIEM DOI VOI SOFTWARE - NHUNG CHUA CONNECTING TOT",
